---
import BaseHead from "../components/BaseHead.astro";
import Header from "../components/Header.astro";
import Footer from "../components/Footer.astro";
import { SITE_TITLE } from "../consts";
---

<!doctype html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <BaseHead
      title={`Case Study: Fruit Fly Classifier | ${SITE_TITLE}`}
      description="Case study: Fruit fly species classification using Computer Vision and Deep Learning."
      titleKey="moscas.meta_title"
      descriptionKey="moscas.meta_desc"
    />
    <style>
      * {
        box-sizing: border-box;
      }
      body {
        overflow-x: hidden;
        width: 100%;
        margin: 0;
        padding: 0;
      }
      .case-container {
        width: 100%;
        max-width: 800px;
        margin: 0 auto;
        padding: 2rem 1.5rem;
      }

      .navigation-header {
        display: flex;
        justify-content: space-between;
        align-items: center;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 1rem;
      }
      .back-link {
        display: inline-block;
        color: #4a5568;
        text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600;
        transition: color 0.2s ease;
      }
      .back-link:hover {
        color: #000;
      }
      .github-btn {
        display: inline-flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        background: #0f172a;
        color: #fff;
        padding: 0.5rem 1rem;
        border-radius: 6px;
        font-size: 0.9rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        text-decoration: none;
        transition: background 0.2s ease;
      }
      .github-btn:hover {
        background: #1e293b;
      }

      h1 {
        font-size: 2.2rem;
        line-height: 1.2;
        margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      }
      h2 {
        font-size: 1.5rem;
        margin-top: 3rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        border-bottom: 1px solid #eaeaea;
        padding-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }
      h3 {
        font-size: 1.2rem;
        margin-top: 2rem;
        margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
      }
      p,
      li {
        line-height: 1.7;
        color: #4a5568;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .tag-container {
        display: flex;
        flex-wrap: wrap;
        gap: 0.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }
      .tag {
        background: #f1f5f9;
        color: #334155;
        padding: 0.3rem 0.8rem;
        border-radius: 20px;
        font-size: 0.8rem;
        font-weight: 600;
      }

      .info-box {
        background: #f8fafc;
        border: 1px solid #e2e8f0;
        border-left: 4px solid #3b82f6;
        padding: 1.5rem;
        border-radius: 4px;
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
        font-size: 0.95rem;
      }

      .video-wrapper {
        position: relative;
        padding-bottom: 56.25%;
        height: 0;
        margin: 2rem 0;
        background: #0f172a;
        border-radius: 12px;
        overflow: hidden;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 15px -3px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
      }
      .video-wrapper video {
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: 0;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
      }

      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .case-container {
          padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
        }
        h1 {
          font-size: 1.8rem;
        }
        h2 {
          font-size: 1.3rem;
        }
        h3 {
          font-size: 1.1rem;
        }
        .info-box {
          padding: 1rem;
          font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
      }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <Header />
    <main class="case-container">
      <div class="navigation-header">
        <a href="/" class="back-link" data-i18n="action.back_portfolio">&larr; Back to Portfolio</a>
        <a
          href="https://github.com/ErickAndrewBF/moscas-frontend.git"
          target="_blank"
          class="github-btn"
          data-i18n="action.view_github"
        >
          View on GitHub
        </a>
      </div>

      <h1 data-i18n="moscas.title">
        Fruit Fly Species Classifier with Artificial Intelligence
      </h1>

      <div class="tag-container">
        <span class="tag">React</span>
        <span class="tag">Flask</span>
        <span class="tag">Python</span>
        <span class="tag">PyTorch</span>
        <span class="tag" data-i18n="dron.tag_vision">Computer Vision</span>
      </div>

      <div class="info-box">
        <p>
          <strong data-i18n="moscas.notice_title">Thesis / Research Project:</strong>{" "}
          <span data-i18n="moscas.notice_body">
            This prototype was built to automate agricultural pest detection in the fruit industry. It leverages convolutional neural networks to accelerate in-field entomological diagnostics.
          </span>
        </p>
      </div>

      <h2 data-i18n="moscas.challenge_title">The Technical Challenge</h2>
      <p data-i18n-html="moscas.challenge_body">
        Manual identification of fruit flies (notably <em>Anastrepha</em> species and <em>Ceratitis capitata</em>) requires specialized entomologists and high-power microscopes. The challenge consisted in training a lightweight Deep Learning model to classify specimens from standard smartphone photos and serving it through an intuitive Full Stack web application.
      </p>

      <h2 data-i18n="moscas.demo_title">Live Demonstration (Video)</h2>

      <div class="video-wrapper">
        <video controls muted>
          <source src="/demo-moscas.mp4" type="video/mp4" />
          <span data-i18n="action.video_unsupported">Your browser does not support the video tag.</span>
        </video>
      </div>

      <p data-i18n="moscas.demo_intro">
        The technical walkthrough demonstrates the end-to-end platform workflow, from sample selection to model explainability:
      </p>

      <ol>
        <li>
          <strong data-i18n="moscas.step1_title">Navigation & Context:</strong>{" "}
          <span data-i18n="moscas.step1_body">
            Structured tab navigation detailing project motivation, evaluation metrics, and neural network architectures.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong data-i18n="moscas.step2_title">Sample & Model Selection:</strong>{" "}
          <span data-i18n="moscas.step2_body">
            The testing sandbox allows selecting between 1 and 5 sample images across 3 benchmark datasets and choosing which models participate in inference.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong data-i18n="moscas.step3_title">Visual Preprocessing Pipeline:</strong>{" "}
          <span data-i18n="moscas.step3_body">
            Step-by-step display of morphological transformations up to precise pest segmentation, featuring an interactive slider gallery.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong data-i18n="moscas.step4_title">Multi-Model Inference:</strong>{" "}
          <span data-i18n="moscas.step4_body">
            Side-by-side performance comparison of model predictions for each processed specimen.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong data-i18n="moscas.step5_title">Grad-CAM Explainability:</strong>{" "}
          <span data-i18n-html="moscas.step5_body">
            A vital phase for scientific validation: users generate activation heatmaps to inspect exactly which morphological features the network relied on.
          </span>
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong data-i18n="moscas.step6_title">Iterative Workflow:</strong>{" "}
          <span data-i18n="moscas.step6_body">
            Seamless return to the selection sandbox to evaluate new batches without reloading the single-page application.
          </span>
        </li>
      </ol>

      <h2 data-i18n="moscas.solution_title">Architectural Solution</h2>

      <h3 data-i18n="moscas.sol1_title">1. Analytical Backend API (Flask + PyTorch)</h3>
      <p data-i18n-html="moscas.sol1_body">
        Far from a simple prediction endpoint, the backend manages image preprocessing, multi-model memory allocation, intermediate segmentation outputs, and dynamic Grad-CAM computation.
      </p>

      <h3 data-i18n="moscas.sol2_title">2. Scientific Dashboard Frontend (React)</h3>
      <p data-i18n="moscas.sol2_body">
        Designed as an interactive model auditing studio. Handled complex global state coordination, custom step-by-step sliders, and optimized DOM rendering for concurrent heatmaps.
      </p>
    </main>
    <Footer />
  </body>
</html>
